{"id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-iterated-consistency.md","title":"Iterated Consistency Statement","display":"df-iterated-consistency — Iterated Consistency Statement","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-iterated-consistency","aliases":["92-df-iterated-consistency"],"display":"df-iterated-consistency — Iterated Consistency Statement","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-theory-closure]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-iterated-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-iterated-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iterated-consistency — Iterated Consistency Statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\)</span> (recursively axiomatized base theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\)</span> (theory-closure operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"668e712bdadc015a\" href=\"?note=668e712bdadc015a\" title=\"92-df-theory-closure\">92-df-theory-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)\\)</span> (canonical system presented by a sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}\\)</span> (a uniformly chosen arithmetized consistency sentence for each recursively axiomatized <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\">\\((T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\)</span> (definition targets)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT^{(0)}&amp;\\coloneqq T,\\\\\nT^{(n+1)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\Bigl(T^{(n)}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})}\\}\\Bigr)\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT^{(0)}&amp;\\coloneqq T,\\\\\nT^{(n+1)}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\Bigl(T^{(n)}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})}\\}\\Bigr)\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>迭代一致性：反复添加一致性陈述</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0=T\">\\(T_0=T\\)</span>，而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{n+1}\">\\(T_{n+1}\\)</span>是把关于规范呈现<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T_n)\\)</span>的一致性句加入后再闭合所得的理论</li>\n<li>单句扩张保持递归可公理化；最后一行还依赖一致性句能由理论呈现统一有效地产生</li>\n<li>若每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span>都相容、满足第二不完备性定理的强度与可导性条件，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\">\\(T_n\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\)</span>，而<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{n+1}\">\\(T_{n+1}\\)</span>按构造证明它</li>\n<li>要进一步称<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span>中“独立”或断言每一层都相容，还需排除<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\">\\(T_n\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)\\)</span>，例如加入适当可靠性假设；普通相容性本身不够</li>\n<li>在这些附加条件下形成无穷递增的一致性层级</li>\n<li>不完备性无限延伸</li>\n<li>与证明论序数相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-closure","status":"resolved","id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cn}_G$ (theory-closure operator, see [[92-df-theory-closure]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)$ (canonical system presented by a sentence set, see [[92-df-theory-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}$ (a uniformly chosen arithmetized consistency sentence for each recursively axiomatized $S$, see [[92-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(S)}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N},\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT^{(0)}&\\coloneqq T,\\\\\nT^{(n+1)}&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Cn}_G\\Bigl(T^{(n)}\\cup\n\\{\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})}\\}\\Bigr)\n\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T^{(n)})},\\\\\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)&\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T^{(n)}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_0=T","display":false},{"tex":"T_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T_n)","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_n\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_n\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_n(T)","display":false}],"bytes":2169,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3886f8e5c8d0f18","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ (iterated-consistency progression, see [[92-df-iterated-consistency]])"},{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(T^{(n)})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}$ (iterated consistency theories, see [[92-df-iterated-consistency]])"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]